25
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.600
Sort of, first... first job after leaving college, really.

26
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.200
So we met at work, actually, didn't we? Yeah.

27
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.200
We were both working at a pet shop, and... Oh, really?

28
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.700
Yeah, that's how we met.

29
00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.700
Yeah, me in the pet shop bit and Lara's a groomer.

30
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.800
So this is my dad.

31
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.000
What would you like to say about yourself?

32
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.000
This is one of my daughters. I've got two. Very nice.

33
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.200
