And what's the age gap? What's the age difference? Seven years.

40
00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.700
Okay. Yeah. Okay.

41
00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:01.200
When did you realise you are friends with your daughter?

42
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.400
When did you realise you are friends with your dad?

43
