It took a little while, but erm...

44
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.200
we went away for a little while, and it's come back.

45
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.700
Yeah. So that was nice.

46
00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:16.200
Yeah, so as adults. As adults. But, fairly recently, yeah.

47
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:16.900
That's nice. Yes.

48
00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.800
What would you say, then, is the other person's best quality, then?

49
00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.500
Oh!

50
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:29.700
