With you, or? With me.

59
00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:58.000
She's very level-headed. And, I'm not. Oh, that's nice.

60
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.000
That's a nice compliment. Yes.

61
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:06.000
What would you say is the other person's best feature, or quality, as a friend?

62
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Well, Ellie's just lovely, inside and out.

63
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.800
Well, so is Sue. She's just so, so... we love each other!

64
00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:19.000
