65
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.600
So. Yes. Yes!

66
00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.600
I can always rely on her. Completely.

67
00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.600
Oh! Well, we were just talking about it, really.

68
00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.600
Honesty. Honesty.

69
