75
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:54.800
So, I think it's a shared... Interests. Interests.

76
00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:59.600
What would you say is the other person's best quality, as a friend?

77
00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:04.000
Oh! Oh!

78
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.600
I think just very non-judgemental.

79
