Right, my daughter's very calm and collected and rational.

87
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:37.000
And er... my other daughter's a bit different.

88
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.800
Very diplomatic. Yeah.

89
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:44.500
I'd just say my dad was very supportive and always there,

90
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.800
