91
00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:53.800
I would say that you are very, very kind and caring

92
00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.800
and someone that's really thoughtful

93
00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.600
and thinks about everyone's sort of, situation and feelings,

94
00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.800
