97
00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.000
That's great, that's a good like, makeup.

98
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.200
I would say the same. Yeah. I think you're a very good listener.

99
00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.800
Very good at giving advice, as well.

100
00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.000
Erm...

101
