102
00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.800
She's very reliable and very trustworthy.

103
00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:25.000
And... yeah, I would trust her with anything. That's great.

104
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.000
What would you say is like, one of the most important features

